// =====================================================================
// /app/briefs/import-pdfs — Bulk PDF import · block a9e5f248 on /pdf.
//
// Replaces the March-era Conditional Form + PDF-table flow (which the
// app no longer reads). One surface, two modes:
//
//   CREATE  — drop up to 20 PDFs and each becomes a brief in the
//             chosen project: uploaded, read by OpenRouter's free
//             cloudflare-ai parser, sections mapped VERBATIM (same
//             section model as the create chat), name detected, PDF
//             written to the brief's own `attachment` (dgOkq). Files
//             over the 4MB reading cap still import, attach-only.
//   ATTACH  — drop PDFs for briefs that already exist (the CSV-first
//             crowd): each file is auto-matched to a brief in the
//             project by filename, with a per-file override select,
//             and APPENDS to that brief's `attachment`.
//
// Queue runs 2 files at a time. Unreadable PDFs never block an import:
// the brief is still created/attached and sections wait in the builder.
//
// MULTI-SOURCE: every hook passes `from`. Connection ids below are
// this block's own (wired via MCP 2026-08-27).
//
// OPENROUTER: "Brief Builder| Open Router | BL" wired by Bev in the
// Studio Source tab 2026-08-27 (MCP cannot wire REST sources), so the
// AI mapping is LIVE. Reading is free (cloudflare-ai parser); only
// the section sorting costs, and that runs on the cheap model first.
// =====================================================================

